<title>POLAND: Elektrim revises down H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Elektrim revises down H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrim SA final results for first half ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 1996	H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     19.60  vs    8.69</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 89.55  vs   35.57</p>
<p>    net profit			     17.41  vs   13.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Elektrim SA. Earlier the company reported a net profit of 21.75 million zlotys and pre-tax profit of 93.3 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     426.55  vs  288.90</p>
<p>    costs of sales			365.50  vs  291.31</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     33.55  vs    7.42</p>
<p>    other taxes				  -  vs	 -</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  141.71  vs   69.76</p>
<p>    financial costs			73.92  vs   43.77</p>
<p>    investment			    192.63  vs   77.00</p>
<p>    depreciation			    1.93  vs    1.32</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
